Source: classicube
Section: games
Priority: optional
Maintainer: PS3 Linux project <ps3@localhost>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), libsdl3-dev, libgl-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://www.classicube.net/

Package: classicube
Architecture: ppc64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libopenal1
Description: ClassiCube block building game, with sounds and music
 A Minecraft Classic compatible game (SDL3 window and gamepad, desktop GL 1, OpenAL), with its
 texture pack, sounds and music. /usr/games/classicube runs it from a per-user directory
 (~/.local/share/classicube), where it keeps options, maps and screenshots.
